## Check Packages installed in airflow-worker
```bash
docker-compose exec airflow-worker python -m pip list

# specifically check dbt packages
docker-compose exec airflow-worker python -m pip list | Select-String "dbt"

# If no dbt-snowflake package found. Install the same
docker-compose exec --user root airflow-worker pip install dbt-snowflake 
#But this is not allowed in latest version at runtime it is not allowed. To be added inside environment of x-airflow-common: in docker-compose.yml file and complete restart 

# To check dbt-snowflake connection
docker-compose exec airflow-worker bash -c "cd /opt/airflow/dags/dbt_project && dbt debug --profiles-dir ."

# Any issue for fetching token restart api server
docker-compose restart airflow-apiserver
```